     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I would appreciate any hint to where I went wrong.<span style=\"font-size:13px\"> minimal example:</span><div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#000\">o</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;item1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;item2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;item3&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;item4&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>m1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;<br> factor =~ c(f1,f1,f1)*item1 + item2 + item3 + item4<br>&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>s1_resid </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sem</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> m1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> d1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ordered </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> estimator </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;WLSMV&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> missing </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pairwise&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></font><span style=\"color:#000\">parameterization </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;theta&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;year&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">equal </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;loadings&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;thresholds&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><font color=\"#008800\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;residuals&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># works fine </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">m1_cov</span></font><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39; <br> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0);font-size:13.1428575515747px\"><span style=\"color:#080\">factor =~ c(f1,f1,f1)*item1 + item2 + item3 + item4<br> factor ~ age<br>&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span><font color=\"#660066\" style=\"font-size:13.1428575515747px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">s1_cov </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sem</span><span style=\"