iduals&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># does not work and </span><span style=\"color:#800\">I don&#39;t understand the error message</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color:#606\">Fehler</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> match</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nomatch </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;to&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> must be of length </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
